  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Corredores Viales en el Estado de Baha</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Highway Corridors in the State of Bahia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM COMPRISES FOUR SUBPROGRAMS: 1. IMPROVEMENT AND PAVING OF 750KM; 2. REHABILITATION OF 600KM; 3. MAINTENANCE OF STATE HIGHWAYS; 4. INSTITUTIONAL STRENGHTENING OF THE EXECUTING AGENCY (DERBA). THE CIVIL WORK AND ACTIVITIES WILL BE AN IMPORTANT FACTOR FOR THE INTEGRATION OF TRANSPORTATION MODES AND THE DEVELOPMENT OF THE STATE ECONOMY, INCLUDING THE IMPROVEMENT OF THE MAINTENANCE SYSTEM AND ROAD SAFETY .</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
